                    'Suite v2.0.0! Territory has been expanded FAR BEYOND the database ' . 
                    'connection management and request delivery methods (which ' . 
                    'simply "send the query") boundaries. Requests will be batched ' . 
                    'together (per each connection), and...new to v2.0.0...micro-batches ' . 
